Reg "0..*" --> "1" Donor : « subject »
Flag "0..*" --> "1" Donor : « subject »
Test "0..*" --> "0..1" Donor : « subject »
Report "0..*" --> "0..*" Test : « result »
Coll "0..*" --> "1" Donor : « subject »
Unit "0..*" --> "0..1" Donor : « collection.source »
Comp "0..*" --> "0..*" Unit : « parent »
Order "0..*" --> "1" Recipient : « subject »
SReq "0..*" --> "0..*" Order : « basedOn »
SDel "0..*" --> "0..*" SReq : « basedOn »
SDel "0..*" --> "0..*" Comp : « suppliedItem.itemReference »
Disp "0..*" --> "1" Comp : « product »
Disp "0..*" --> "1" Recipient : « patient »
Tx "0..*" --> "0..*" Order : « basedOn »
Tx "0..*" --> "0..*" Comp : « used »
Tx "0..*" --> "1" Recipient : « subject »
AE "0..*" --> "0..*" Comp : « suspectEntity »

caption Klinik graf: tashkilotlar, tibbiyot xodimlari va boshqa ishtirokchilarga havolalar diagramma o'qilishi uchun tushirib qoldirilgan. Flag UZ Core ning keyingi relizida bo'ladi; BiologicallyDerivedProductDispense uchun UZ Core profili hali yo'q.

